The new capture-gate suite is the first RN test to import the SDK entry
point, which transitively resolves the real react-native package. That
package ships Flow-typed ESM, and which export condition wins depends on
the npm and Node version, so the suite passed on the developer machine
(node 26, pre-existing node_modules) and failed on CI (node 24, fresh
npm ci). A jest.mock factory in the test did not prevent the parse.
